st zombies and cyborgs\n- cold war story\n- unique execution system\n- exciting fps combat\n- amazing graphics", "short_description": "Be part of an exciting cold war spy story.\n\nAs a CIA agent you have to infiltrate into a soviet underground facility and gather as much information as possible about their secret project.\nBut it won't be easy for you because this is one of the most guarded place in the world."}]}, "developer_name": "Technical Troupers", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://metro2.tech-tro.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://metro2.tech-tro.com/privacy-policy", "publisher_name": "Technical Troupers", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://metro2.tech-tro.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ACTION", "CASUAL", "HORROR", "SHOOTER", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US", "en_GB"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "239421851718213"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1909429469097909", "version": "1.003"}, "id": "108271096558905", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1898302430210613", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "And